<title>AUSTRALIA: FAI Insurances property float closes early.</title>
<headline>FAI Insurances property float closes early.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>FAI Insurances Ltd said on Friday its Australian Commercial Property Trust float had closed over-subscribed.</p>
<p>FAI said the underwriter ANZ Securities Ltd felt it was necessary to close the offer early as the full subscription level had been reached with a continuing demand for units.</p>
<p>Scaling back of allotments had ocurred, it said.</p>
<p>The trust is expected to list in late August.</p>
<p>The trust, managed by FAI funds management arm, had over A$192 million invested in 11 office buildings across Australia.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
